    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity has established a frontline base on a distant planet rich in rare energy, conducting research and extraction operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a mysterious alien force suddenly emerged from the planet\u2019s depths, severing base communications and causing the outer facilities to fall one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a combat robot from an expedition unit, launching from the last secure control room within the base. Your mission: carry out a series of high-risk operations\u2014fight off invaders, gather critical resources, assist scientists in rebooting essential systems, and gradually uncover the secrets buried within this planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat That Rewards Timing: Fast Reload Mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6a675d8d72073fcae91cba2c77b31ff6.poster.avif?t=1749995436\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6a675d8d72073fcae91cba2c77b31ff6.webm?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6a675d8d72073fcae91cba2c77b31ff6.mp4?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/f013039f96efc80dbe42f135d4e80527.poster.avif?t=1749995436\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/f013039f96efc80dbe42f135d4e80527.webm?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/f013039f96efc80dbe42f135d4e80527.mp4?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every reload presents a chance to trigger a \u201cPerfect Reload\u201d, empowering your next attack or skill. Mastering timing and rhythm is key to dominating the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable Equipment and Skill Loadouts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6bff978eca0613b299a6aa83fe82b134.poster.avif?t=1749995436\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6bff978eca0613b299a6aa83fe82b134.webm?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6bff978eca0613b299a6aa83fe82b134.mp4?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/c9e9eeffe1cdec926e6ea30a480dd6ae.poster.avif?t=1749995436\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/c9e9eeffe1cdec926e6ea30a480dd6ae.webm?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/c9e9eeffe1cdec926e6ea30a480dd6ae.mp4?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/4619ede7a9d83d88ef405ff090dc2eec.poster.avif?t=1749995436\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/4619ede7a9d83d88ef405ff090dc2eec.webm?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/4619ede7a9d83d88ef405ff090dc2eec.mp4?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each mission, freely configure your loadout: primary weapon, secondary weapon, ammo type, active skill, and support items\u2014crafting a unique combat style and strategic approach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mission-Driven Level Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission features a primary objective and multiple randomized secondary goals, enriched with step-based progress and challenge events for fast-paced and varied gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Exploration and Progressive Unlocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully completing missions and retreating allows you to bring back rare resources. Use these to unlock skill modules, new weapons, and character upgrades\u2014expanding both narrative progression and gameplay depth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Risk, High-Reward Combat Runs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With limited battlefield resources and ever-advancing enemies, each decision\u2014to retreat or push deeper\u2014carries weight and may reshape your growth and rewards.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity has established a frontline base on a distant planet rich in rare energy, conducting research and extraction operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a mysterious alien force suddenly emerged from the planet\u2019s depths, severing base communications and causing the outer facilities to fall one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a combat robot from an expedition unit, launching from the last secure control room within the base. Your mission: carry out a series of high-risk operations\u2014fight off invaders, gather critical resources, assist scientists in rebooting essential systems, and gradually uncover the secrets buried within this planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat That Rewards Timing: Fast Reload Mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6a675d8d72073fcae91cba2c77b31ff6.poster.avif?t=1749995436\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6a675d8d72073fcae91cba2c77b31ff6.webm?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6a675d8d72073fcae91cba2c77b31ff6.mp4?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/f013039f96efc80dbe42f135d4e80527.poster.avif?t=1749995436\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/f013039f96efc80dbe42f135d4e80527.webm?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/f013039f96efc80dbe42f135d4e80527.mp4?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every reload presents a chance to trigger a \u201cPerfect Reload\u201d, empowering your next attack or skill. Mastering timing and rhythm is key to dominating the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable Equipment and Skill Loadouts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6bff978eca0613b299a6aa83fe82b134.poster.avif?t=1749995436\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6bff978eca0613b299a6aa83fe82b134.webm?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/6bff978eca0613b299a6aa83fe82b134.mp4?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/c9e9eeffe1cdec926e6ea30a480dd6ae.poster.avif?t=1749995436\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/c9e9eeffe1cdec926e6ea30a480dd6ae.webm?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/c9e9eeffe1cdec926e6ea30a480dd6ae.mp4?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/4619ede7a9d83d88ef405ff090dc2eec.poster.avif?t=1749995436\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/4619ede7a9d83d88ef405ff090dc2eec.webm?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893070/extras/4619ede7a9d83d88ef405ff090dc2eec.mp4?t=1749995436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each mission, freely configure your loadout: primary weapon, secondary weapon, ammo type, active skill, and support items\u2014crafting a unique combat style and strategic approach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mission-Driven Level Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission features a primary objective and multiple randomized secondary goals, enriched with step-based progress and challenge events for fast-paced and varied gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Exploration and Progressive Unlocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully completing missions and retreating allows you to bring back rare resources. Use these to unlock skill modules, new weapons, and character upgrades\u2014expanding both narrative progression and gameplay depth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Risk, High-Reward Combat Runs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With limited battlefield resources and ever-advancing enemies, each decision\u2014to retreat or push deeper\u2014carries weight and may reshape your growth and rewards.</p>",
    "short_description": "Mutation Surge is a fast-paced, twin-stick action shooter with light roguelike elements, presented in a 2D top-down style. By timing your reloads precisely, you can trigger enhanced effects for your skills and attacks, adding both depth and satisfaction to the combat experience!",
